adequate to (acc.). अव be in order or right, answer, serve, be fit
for (dat.). C. prepare, arrange, employ. उप the same;
 C. also
procure, fetch;
 assign, destine for or to (dat. or loc.);
 assume, state.
परि C. fix. settle, determine, choose, contrive, arrange, distribute
(with a num. in धा), invent, imagine, believe, suppose, regard as
(acc.). प्र proceed well, succeed;
 be right or in order. C. arrange,
prepare, fix, settle, appoint to (loc.);
 choose for (acc.), contrive,
effect. वि shift, change;
 fluctuate, balance;
 be doubtful or optional
(g.). C. make, form, compose, distribute;
 choose, select;
 consider as
doubtful, state as optional or arbitrary (g.);
 suppose, imagine, invent.
सम् be all right, succeed, prosper. C. join together, produce, create;
assign, destine, settle, determine, intend, imagine, appoint to (loc.);
consider or regard as (acc. w. इव). उपसम् put down, appoint,
select. — Cf. अभिकॢप्त, उ॑पकॢप्त, प्र॑कॢप्त, संकॢप्त.

